                    We are looking for a motivated and confident Appointment Setter to join our team. The ideal candidate is a strong communicator who can build rapport quickly, handle objections professionally, and consistently book qualified appointments.



Responsibilities

- Conduct outbound cold calls to prospective business clients

- Engage leads in natural, professional conversations

- Handle objections confidently and effectively

- Book qualified appointments for the sales team

- Follow provided lead lists and scripts

- Update and maintain CRM records accurately

- Complete daily spreadsheets and activity tracking reports

- Maintain consistency in daily outreach and follow-up efforts



Requirements

// Prior B2B cold calling or appointment setting experience preferred

// Fluent English communication skills (spoken and written)

// Strong interpersonal and rapport-building abilities

// Self-motivated, dependable, and results-driven

// Comfortable working independently

// Strong time management and organizational skills

// Consistent work ethic and performance
